  {
    "unit_id": "u0034",
    "excerpt": "`MapiMessage` is the primary high-level entry point for creating, editing, and converting\nmessages; `CfbReader`/`CfbWriter` and `MsgReader`/`MsgWriter`/`MsgDocument` provide direct,\nlower-level access to the `Aspose.Email.Foss.Cfb` and `Aspose.Email.Foss.Msg` namespaces the\nhigh-level API is built on. The public surface spans 29 classes and enumerations in a single\nmodule, summarized below.",
    "disposition": "merged_reframed",
    "target_section": "API Reference",
    "classification": "2_mechanism_explanation",
    "verification": {
      "status": "verified_against_source",
